{"name":"Velddrif","hex":"#a17d61","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Velddrif","blocks":[{"text":"Velddrif or Velddrift, is a coastal fishing town in the Bergrivier Local Municipality, Western Cape, South Africa. The town had a population 12507 in 2015 and is located on the estuary at which the Berg River flows into St. Helena Bay."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Velddrif.jpg/330px-Velddrif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Velddrif"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Bokkoms_Velddrif_-_West_Coast%2C_South_Africa_%283918637765%29.jpg/500px-Bokkoms_Velddrif_-_West_Coast%2C_South_Africa_%283918637765%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Bokkoms_Velddrif_-_West_Coast%2C_South_Africa_%283918637765%29.jpg/1280px-Bokkoms_Velddrif_-_West_Coast%2C_South_Africa_%283918637765%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Bokkoms_Velddrif_-_West_Coast%2C_South_Africa_%283918637765%29.jpg/500px-Bokkoms_Velddrif_-_West_Coast%2C_South_Africa_%283918637765%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABokkoms_Velddrif_-_West_Coast%2C_South_Africa_(3918637765).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Velddrif_Bird_View.jpg/500px-Velddrif_Bird_View.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Velddrif_Bird_View.jpg/1280px-Velddrif_Bird_View.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Velddrif_B